{"id":"torrey:communion-of-the-lords-supper","source":"torrey","name":"Communion Of The Lord’s Supper","slug":"communion-of-the-lords-supper","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Prefigured — Ex 12:21-28; 1Co 5:7,8.","refs":[["Exod",12,21,12,28],["1Cor",5,7,5,7],["1Cor",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Instituted — Mt 26:26; 1Co 11:23.","refs":[["Matt",26,26,26,26],["1Cor",11,23,11,23]]},{"text":"Object of — Lu 22:19; 1Co 11:24,26.","refs":[["Luke",22,19,22,19],["1Cor",11,24,11,24],["1Cor",11,26,11,26]]},{"text":"Is the communion of the body and blood of Christ — 1Co 10:16.","refs":[["1Cor",10,16,10,16]]},{"text":"Both bread and wine are necessary to be received in — Mt 26:27; 1Co 11:26.","refs":[["Matt",26,27,26,27],["1Cor",11,26,11,26]]},{"text":"Self-examination commanded before partaking of — 1Co 11:28,31.","refs":[["1Cor",11,28,11,28],["1Cor",11,31,11,31]]},{"text":"Newness of heart and life necessary to the worthy partaking of — 1Co 5:7,8.","refs":[["1Cor",5,7,5,7],["1Cor",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Partakers of, be wholly separate to God — 1Co 10:21.","refs":[["1Cor",10,21,10,21]]},{"text":"Was continually partaken of, by the Church — Ac 2:42; 20:7.","refs":[["Acts",2,42,2,42],["Acts",20,7,20,7]]},{"text":"Are guilty of the body and blood of Christ. — 1Co 11:27.","refs":[["1Cor",11,27,11,27]]},{"text":"Discern not the Lord’s body. — 1Co 11:29.","refs":[["1Cor",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"Are visited with judgments. — 1Co 11:30.","refs":[["1Cor",11,30,11,30]]}],"refCount":21}
